and imaging principles. But the reaction history shows the user dislikes \"条件与原理\" articles. \n\nHmm, but the reaction history is \"old evidence\" potentially. The instructions say preferences with origin=user and user-edited descriptions are explicit requirements. But here the preferences list is empty. The interest description is the user's authored text.\n\nThe interest description doesn't explicitly ban \"条件与原理\" content. It mentions imaging principles as something of interest. But the reaction history shows clear dislike of that content type.\n\nGiven the reaction history is the strongest behavioral signal and shows a consistent pattern (liked all 操作记录, disliked all 条件与原理), I'll weight toward 操作记录 content. This aligns with \"实际拍摄方法\" (actual shooting methods) in the interest description too.\n\nLet me select 5 operation records with topic diversity. Let me pick across different topics and conditions.\n\nI'll go with these 5 covering distinct topics:\n1. item-86b7ce972cea: 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的操作记录\n2. item-817629f08d1c: 雨天反光：黄昏户外中的操作记录\n3. item-734464ef3a3b: 静物布光：窗边自然光中的操作记录\n4. item-8841d4bfa662: 运动追焦：阴天街道中的操作记录\n5. item-bbf77090b9cb: 街头构图：阴天街道中的操作记录\n\nThese cover 5 distinct topics (逆光人像, 雨天反光, 静物布光, 运动追焦, 街头构图) and various conditions. This provides good balance.\n\nLet me publish these recommendations.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-86b7ce972cea","recommendationReason":"你此前对多篇“操作记录”类摄影文章都点了赞，而这篇正是逆光人像在黄昏户外的操作记录，教你固定构图与光线后逐次调整参数并比较高光、暗部与主体细节，符合你关注实际拍摄方法与不同条件下调整的学习方向。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-817629f08d1c","recommendationReason":"延续你对操作记录类内容的偏好，这篇雨天反光在黄昏户外的操作记录通过逐次改变参数并记录画面差异来调整设置，能帮你掌握反光场景下的具体调整手法，与你关注不同条件下拍摄方法一致。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-734464ef3a3b","recommendationReason":"你喜欢的操作记录类内容中尚未覆盖静物布光主题，这篇窗边自然光下的静物布光操作记录提供了一套固定构图光线、逐次调参并比较细节的实操流程，为你的布光学习补充新的场景案例。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-8841d4bfa662","recommendationReason":"运动追焦是你此前点赞过的操作记录主题的延伸，这篇阴天街道中的操作记录通过逐次改变拍摄参数